# **CHARACTER GENERATION FLAG**

Rick and Tina look to guiltily to each other then back at Ruby.

Ruby notices the look and her face fills with suspicion.

RUBY

Either of you seen her?

This time when Rick and Tina look at each other Rick gives a barely perceptible shake of his head.

Ruby sees it and makes sour-face.

RUBY

You two get the fuck away from me before I bop you both upside the head with this coffee mug!

